# cvg-vxlan documentation

When editing files under `docs/`, follow [docs/AGENTS.md](../docs/AGENTS.md):

- Keep **architecture** in `WORKFLOWS.md`, **flags/reference** in `USAGE_GUIDE.md`
- Put **runnable one-task examples** in `docs/examples/<task>.md`
- Update `docs/README.md` and `docs/examples/README.md` indexes when adding docs
- Do not duplicate long command blocks across files — link to examples instead

Documentation index: [docs/README.md](../docs/README.md)
